cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this compute harness or build on it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "crabcc-autoresearch: autonomous ML research loop for λ-term normalization classification"
abstract: >-
  A headless, cost-transparent GPU compute harness that runs Karpathy's autoresearch
  loop to train a small transformer classifying λ-term normalization status
  (SN / SEP / NWN / UND). Automatically archives training artifacts to the
  lambda-normalization-census open dataset after each run.
authors:
